%N A402585 Numbers k such that gcd(k, A344005(k)) > gcd(k, 1+A344005(k)), where A344005(n) is the smallest positive m such that n divides the oblong number m*(m+1).
%H A402585 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A402585/b402585.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%F A402585 {k such that A345992(k) > A345993(k)}.
%o A402585 (PARI)
%o A402585 A354989(n) = for(m=1, oo, if((m*(m+1))%n==0, return(gcd(n, 1+m)<gcd(n, m))));
%o A402585 is_A402585(k) = A354989(k);
%Y A402585 Positions of negative terms in A354988.
%Y A402585 Cf. A354989 (characteristic function).
%Y A402585 Cf. A344005, A345992, A345993.
%Y A402585 Cf. also A345995 (sequence which up to Nov 22 2026 had incorrectly a name matching the definition of this sequence).
